  "description": "Kang Tae-Shin, an idol-turned-actor whose character is always controversial, and Ban Han-Seo, a popular child actor with a face that is building up a good story. The two were secretly dating... That is, until 6 years ago. One day, when Kang Tae-Shin's assault incident broke out, Ban Han-Seo, as the sole witness, asked to have a relationship in exchange for covering up the scandal...\n\n *\"I didn't know you would really have sex with me, Tae-Shin.\"*\n\n(Source: BookCube, translated)",
